{
  "key": "node_s04",
  "kind": "terminal",
  "w": 1440, "h": 900,
  "title": "jason@MacBook-Pro: ~/projects/demo-node — OData 读请求实测",
  "lh": 19,
  "caption": "用 curl 直接读服务：$select/$orderby、$expand=items、无绑定函数 getOrderSummary()、匿名 401 与只读实体 405（长 JSON 已折行，ID 尾部以 … 省略）",
  "label": "本地实机运行",
  "src": "本地实测：curl（CSV 初始数据状态）",
  "lines": [
    "$ SVC=http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/book-order ; A='-u alice:alice'",
    "$ curl -s $A \"$SVC/BookOrders?$select=orderNo,status,totalAmount&$orderby=orderNo\"",
    "{\"@odata.context\":\"$metadata#BookOrders\",\"value\":[",
    "  {\"orderNo\":\"BO-1001\",\"status\":\"OPEN\",\"totalAmount\":16000,\"ID\":\"4a1f8c03-0001-…\",\"IsActiveEntity\":true},",
    "  {\"orderNo\":\"BO-1002\",\"status\":\"OPEN\",\"totalAmount\":3600,\"ID\":\"4a1f8c03-0002-…\",\"IsActiveEntity\":true},",
    "  {\"orderNo\":\"BO-1003\",\"status\":\"SUBMITTED\",\"totalAmount\":17400,\"ID\":\"4a1f8c03-0003-…\",\"IsActiveEntity\":true},",
    "  {\"orderNo\":\"BO-1004\",\"status\":\"CLOSED\",\"totalAmount\":7600,\"ID\":\"4a1f8c03-0004-…\",\"IsActiveEntity\":true}]}",
    "",
    "$ curl -s $A \"$SVC/BookOrders?$filter=orderNo eq 'BO-1001'&$expand=items\"",
    "{\"@odata.context\":\"$metadata#BookOrders\",\"value\":[{\"ID\":\"4a1f8c03-0001-…\",\"orderNo\":\"BO-1001\",",
    "  \"customer_ID\":1000,\"orderDate\":\"2026-09-01\",\"status\":\"OPEN\",\"totalAmount\":16000,",
    "  \"items\":[{\"ID\":\"5b2f9d10-0001-…\",\"book_ID\":1001,\"quantity\":2,\"amount\":8400},",
    "           {\"ID\":\"5b2f9d10-0002-…\",\"book_ID\":1003,\"quantity\":1,\"amount\":2800},",
    "           {\"ID\":\"5b2f9d10-0003-…\",\"book_ID\":1005,\"quantity\":1,\"amount\":4800}],\"IsActiveEntity\":true}]}",
    "",
    "$ curl -s $A \"$SVC/getOrderSummary()\"",
    "{\"@odata.context\":\"$metadata#Collection(BookOrderService.OrderSummaryRow)\",\"value\":[",
    "  {\"orderNo\":\"BO-1001\",\"customerName\":\"北京华信书业\",\"orderDate\":\"2026-09-01\",\"status\":\"OPEN\",\"itemCount\":3,\"totalAmount\":16000},",
    "  {\"orderNo\":\"BO-1002\",\"customerName\":\"北京华信书业\",\"orderDate\":\"2026-09-03\",\"status\":\"OPEN\",\"itemCount\":1,\"totalAmount\":3600},",
    "  {\"orderNo\":\"BO-1003\",\"customerName\":\"上海博文出版中心\",\"orderDate\":\"2026-09-05\",\"status\":\"SUBMITTED\",\"itemCount\":3,\"totalAmount\":17400},",
    "  {\"orderNo\":\"BO-1004\",\"customerName\":\"广州南方图书\",\"orderDate\":\"2026-09-08\",\"status\":\"CLOSED\",\"itemCount\":2,\"totalAmount\":7600}]}",
    "",
    "$ curl -s -o /dev/null -w '%{http_code}\\n' \"$SVC/BookOrders\"                      # 匿名",
    "401",
    "$ curl -s -o /dev/null -w '%{http_code}\\n' $A -X POST \"$SVC/OrderItemView\" -d '{}'  # 只读实体",
    "405"
  ],
  "callouts": [
    {"on": "  {\"orderNo\":\"BO-1001\",\"status\":\"OPEN\",\"totalAmount\":16000,\"ID\":\"4a1f8c03-0001-…\",\"IsActiveEntity\":true},", "text": "1. $select 只取指定列(+键/草稿标记)"},
    {"on": "           {\"ID\":\"5b2f9d10-0002-…\",\"book_ID\":1003,\"quantity\":1,\"amount\":2800},", "text": "2. $expand 由导航属性 items 驱动"},
    {"on": "  {\"orderNo\":\"BO-1001\",\"customerName\":\"北京华信书业\",\"orderDate\":\"2026-09-01\",\"status\":\"OPEN\",\"itemCount\":3,\"totalAmount\":16000},", "text": "3. 聚合只能靠函数（视图无主键）"},
    {"on": "401", "text": "4. @requires 不满足 → 401"},
    {"on": "405", "text": "5. @readonly 实体写操作 → 405"}
  ]
}
